<title>USA: G7 finance ministers did not discuss dollar.</title>
<headline>G7 finance ministers did not discuss dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group of Seven finance ministers did not discuss the dollar on Friday, European Commissioner Yves Thibault de Silguy told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;It wasn't raised. Not at the dinner tonight.&quot;</p>
</text>
